/// S5 (ratified): line comments run from this prefix to end of line.
COMMENT_PREFIX: "//"

/// S49 (ratified): a doc comment is a line comment that opens with this
/// prefix. Its text is plain prose, and `jet test` runs its examples.
DOC_COMMENT_PREFIX: "///"

/// S5 (ratified 2026-06-15): block comments `/* … */`, nesting allowed so a
/// region containing other comments can always be commented out.
BLOCK_COMMENT_OPEN: "/*"
BLOCK_COMMENT_CLOSE: "*/"
